      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STIFLER (2) is a quick dog who thrives over the short dashes. Was a strong winner last time (16.75) over 300m at this track in a Other. Form at the trip excellent including 19 wins. Has good early burn and is drawn to be prominent. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. CRAZED (4) has a terrific record here with three wins and two placings from five starts. Hit the frame latest (16.88) when third at this track in a Other. Looks a key chance on best figures. YARRAMUNDI OPAL (8) goes very well this course and distance starting 56 times for 21 wins and 21 minors. In the money last time at this track (16.80) in a Other, finishing a 0.8 lengths second. Can feature with the right run. TECHNO KELLI (1) placed last time at big odds - worth some thought.",
